[{"ave_id":"AVE-2006-0007","file_name":"2006/AVE-2006-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2006-10003","title":"Perl XML::Parser 堆缓冲区越界写入漏洞","description":"XML::Parser 是 Perl 语言中广泛使用的 XML 解析库，其 2.47 及之前版本在 st_serial_stack 函数中存在差一（off-by-one）堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当解析深度嵌套的 XML 元素且栈指针（stackptr）等于 stacksize - 1 时，本应触发栈扩展的代码未执行，导致新值被写入紧邻分配缓冲区边界之外的位置，造成堆内存越界写入。远程攻击者可通过向目标应用提交特制的深度嵌套 XML 文档触发该漏洞，造成堆内存破坏，可能导致拒绝服务或远程代码执行。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2006-10003"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-03-19T12:16:17Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:16:55Z","remediation":"立即将 Perl XML::Parser 模块升级至 2.48 或更高版本（最新版为 2.59）。可通过 CPAN 执行 `cpan -U XML::Parser` 更新。Red Hat 系系统请安装对应 RHSA 安全更新（如 RHEL 7 升级 perl-XML-Parser 至 2.41-10.el7_9.1，RHEL 8 升级至 2.44-12.el8_10，RHEL 10 升级至 2.47-6.1.el10_1）；Debian Bullseye 用户请参照 LTS 公告安装补丁。临时缓解措施可在无法升级的环境中限制解析深层嵌套 XML 文档，或对 XML 输入进行预处理校验以防止触发堆越界写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cpan-authors/XML-Parser/commit/3eb9cc95420fa0c3f76947c4708962546bf27cfd.patch","https://github.com/cpan-authors/XML-Parser/issues/39","https://rt.cpan.org/Ticket/Display.html?id=19860","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/03/19/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2026/04/msg00002.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7679","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7680","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7681","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:8577","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:8578","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:8608","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:8609","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:8610","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:9110","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:9246","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:9258","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:9259","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:9605","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2006-10003","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2448999","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2006/cve-2006-10003.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/7be276dc02e6de4abaea69af43c5f170b5d1fed8/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-devtools/perl/libxml-parser-perl/CVE-2006-10003.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2006/10xxx/CVE-2006-10003.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3f14a770d93b602b06aecf87f2033bd6818a62d/osv/cve/2006/UBUNTU-CVE-2006-10003.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-03-01_2026-03-19/TIER_2_CVE-2006-10003.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2006-10003","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/1f0131172164da5118cebcfe86d95fcf67ebc271/content/posts/cve-2006-10003.md","https://github.com/openembedded/openembedded-core/blob/90f823defa32477c9dbd91d264f581fdf0ee4068/meta/recipes-devtools/perl/libxml-parser-perl_2.47.bb","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/593bdbc51deef90595839eb5f1cfcb624c57384b/2006/10xxx/CVE-2006-10003.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2006-10003.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2006-10003-2026-05-01-0305"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2006/AVE-2006-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2006-0006","file_name":"2006/AVE-2006-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2006-10002","title":"XML::Parser Perl 模块堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Perl 的 XML::Parser 组件（版本 2.47 及更早）中的 Expat.xs 文件 parse_stream() 函数存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当使用 :utf8 PerlIO 层时，Perl 的 read() 函数返回解码后的字符，而 SvPV() 返回的是多字节 UTF-8 字节，其长度可能超过预分配的缓冲区大小，从而触发堆损坏（double free 或 corruption）导致程序崩溃。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 UTF-8 编码 XML 数据触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务或潜在的内存破坏。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2006-10002"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2026-03-19T12:16:16Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:21:49Z","remediation":"升级 XML::Parser 至 2.46 或更高版本，该版本在 parse_stream() 中修复了 :utf8 PerlIO 层下因 UTF-8 解码字节长度超出缓冲区导致的堆溢出问题。建议在 Perl 代码中将输入流设为 :raw 模式（binmode(STDIN, ':raw')）以避免二次解码风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cpan-authors/XML-Parser/commit/56b0509dfc6b559cd7555ea81ee62e3622069255.patch","https://github.com/cpan-authors/XML-Parser/issues/64","https://metacpan.org/release/TODDR/XML-Parser-2.46/changes","https://rt.cpan.org/Ticket/Display.html?id=19859","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/03/19/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/03/22/3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2006/10xxx/CVE-2006-10002.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3f14a770d93b602b06aecf87f2033bd6818a62d/osv/cve/2006/UBUNTU-CVE-2006-10002.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-03-01_2026-03-19/TIER_3_CVE-2006-10002.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2006-10002","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/1f0131172164da5118cebcfe86d95fcf67ebc271/content/posts/cve-2006-10002.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2940428c4af0a74494ad8b9a5381821f85a9aee0/2006/10xxx/CVE-2006-10002.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2006-10002.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2006-10002-2026-05-01-0305","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/986f88b713cae42a05d283e54e6fe229a76d2603/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-h943-hrx6-86cq/GHSA-h943-hrx6-86cq.json","https://github.com/AOSC-Dev/aosc-os-abbs/blob/2fb4e1ad573cbe10218336f43889103dfad44edd/topics/perl-xml-parser-2.51.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2006/AVE-2006-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2006-0010","file_name":"2006/AVE-2006-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2006-20001","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_dav 越界读取或写入零字节漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 的 mod_dav 模块在处理精心构造的 If: 请求头时存在越界读取或写入漏洞。攻击者可通过发送特制的 If: 请求头，触发堆内存中超出请求头值的单字节读取或写入操作，导致进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.54 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。攻击无需身份认证，远程即可利用，建议升级至 2.4.55 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2006-20001"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2023-01-17T20:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:24:06Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.55 及以上版本（最新稳定版为 2.4.66），该漏洞已在 2.4.55 中修复。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤包含恶意 If: 请求头的流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202309-01","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20230316-0005/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2006/CVE-2006-20001.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2006/CVE-2006-20001.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2006/CVE-2006-20001/README.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2006/CVE-2006-20001.yaml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/27b4da2a63dee42f40203ab163073db13dbc72d1/osv/cve/2006/UBUNTU-CVE-2006-20001.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/active/CVE-2006-20001","https://github.com/vmware/photon/blob/0b37ad6f1c30ccbcabda429e5ce34657065d26ca/SPECS/httpd/httpd.spec","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2006-20001-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/fullwaywang/QlRules/blob/241853bffb1f550aca9b1eba7b1c65f00f09ae18/httpd/CVE-2006-20001_7469547/dav_process_if_header-autogen.ql","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/1ec2440bfd8f47ff50026ffcb22c3a5db913e2af/static/projects/httpd/CVE-2006-20001.osv.json","https://github.com/r1az4r/CVE-2006-20001"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2006/POC-AVE-2006-0010.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2006/EXP-AVE-2006-0010.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2006/AVE-2006-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2006-0014","file_name":"2006/AVE-2006-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2006-7243","title":"PHP NULL字节注入安全限制绕过漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.4之前版本中存在空字节注入漏洞，由于PHP在处理文件路径时未正确过滤\\0（空字节）字符，导致攻击者可在路径名中插入空字节来绕过访问限制。具体而言，攻击者可通过向file_exists等函数传递包含恶意扩展名的路径（如.php\\0.jpg），使PHP仅识别.jpg等安全扩展名而忽略前面的.php，从而绕过文件类型检查或上传限制。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用，影响所有PHP 5.3.4之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2006-7243"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-01-18T20:00:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:34:39Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至 5.3.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了路径名中空字节（\\0）导致的安全绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对用户输入的文件名进行过滤，移除空字节字符（\\0），并严格校验文件扩展名白名单，仅允许预期的扩展名通过。同时建议在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache 的 mod_security）添加规则拦截包含空字节的请求 URI。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/39863","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00006.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-May/158616.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-May/15