缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/msrc/archive/2006/05/19/429353.aspx","http://isc.sans.org/diary.php?storyid=1345","http://isc.sans.org/diary.php?storyid=1346","http://secunia.com/advisories/20153","http://securitytracker.com/id?1016130","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/446012","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/919637.mspx","http://www.osvdb.org/25635","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/18037","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA06-139A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA06-164A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2006/1872","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2006/ms06-027","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/26556","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1418","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1738","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2068","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2006-2492","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2006/CVE-2006-2492.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2006/2xxx/CVE-2006-2492.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2006/CVE-2006-2492","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2006/CVE-2006-2492/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2006/2xxx/CVE-2006-2492.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2006-2492.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend