tes/blob/69a5a3cf926251a00061ec14d208b227367df73d/network/cves/2006/CVE-2006-2173.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8aea42c71147e21c6d32b71ffce877107de995c6/cves/2006/2xxx/CVE-2006-2173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2006/CVE-2006-2173","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e64e866f5c799abe7f39eba36818200f3831f1cb/CVE/data/2006/CVE-2006-2173.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2006/CVE-2006-2173.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2006-2173_20.yaml","https://github.com/roy9495/CVE-Extractor/blob/21bc96060eb3124bb762be8e16b95c7e2b15d4dc/cvelistV5-main/cves/2006/2xxx/CVE-2006-2173.json","https://github.com/michael1981/sfish_pt/blob/14f609d56e35e9810a1de14712293ab47cc03a46/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%2B%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%2B%E7%88%86%E7%A0%B4/X-Scan-v3.3/plugins/filezilla_server_interface_buffer_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/Bmcbob76/prometheus-prime/blob/952c957f0c453e1048be9399b27309a12965e432/NUCLEI_TEMPLATES/network/cves/2006/CVE-2006-2173.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2006/AVE-2006-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2006-0001","file_name":"2006/AVE-2006-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2006-1681","title":"Cherokee HTTPD 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Cherokee HTTPD 0.5 及更早版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的畸形请求触发 HTTP 400 错误，由于错误消息生成时未对用户输入进行正确过滤和转义，导致恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码可被注入并执行。此类攻击需配合用户交互（如点击恶意链接），成功利用后可窃取会话 Cookie 或用于钓鱼攻击。CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2006-1681"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2006-04-11T00:02:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:23:25Z","remediation":"升级 Cherokee HTTPD 至 0.5.1 或更高版本，该版本已对 HTTP 400 错误信息中的用户输入进行正确转义处理，防止 XSS 注入。如无法升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤包含恶意脚本的畸形请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/19587","http://www.osvdb.org/24469","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/430385/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/17408","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2006/1292","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/25698","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202012-09","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2006/CVE-2006-1681.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2006/CVE-2006-1681.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/69a5a3cf926251a00061ec14d208b227367df73d/http/cves/2006/CVE-2006-1681.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2006-1681.js","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2006-1681_5.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2006-1681.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2006-1681_4.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2006-1681-1325.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2006-1681-1323.yaml","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/cent/template1/cve-2006-1681-1327.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8aea42c71147e21c6d32b71ffce877107de995c6/cves/2006/1xxx/CVE-2006-1681.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2006/AVE-2006-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2006-0008","file_name":"2006/AVE-2006-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2006-1547","title":"Apache Struts ActionForm 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache Struts 1.2.9 之前版本中的 ActionForm 组件与 BeanUtils 1.7 结合使用时存在暴露危险方法的漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 multipart/form-data 编码表单，利用参数名引用 getMultipartRequestHandler 公共方法，进而访问 CommonsMultipartRequestHandler 实现及 BeanUtils 内部的未授权元素，导致目标应用拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache Struts 1.2.7 和 1.2.8 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，无需认证即可远程触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2006-1547"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2006-03-30T22:02:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:23:10Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Struts 至 1.2.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ActionForm 中 multipart/form-data 编码表单的拒绝服务问题。如无法立即升级，可限制外部用户提交 multipart 表单数据，或使用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）过滤含异常参数名的 multipart 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://issues.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=38534","http://lists.suse.com/archive/suse-security-announce/2006-May/0004.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/19493","http://secunia.com/advisories/20117","http://securitytracker.com/id?1015856","http://struts.apache.org/struts-doc-1.2.9/userGuide/release-notes.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/17342","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2006/1205","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/25613","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2006-1547","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2006/CVE-2006-1547.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2006/1xxx/CVE-2006-1547.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2006/CVE-2006-1547","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2006/1xxx/CVE-2006-1547.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2006-1547.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudeb